。\n(https://guide.fire-emblem-heroes.com/en-US/01001015000425/)\n\nドレス姿の彼女をリクエストしたいです。こちらはドレスの参考アートです。(https://imgur.com/a/10DdcJ5)\n(彼女のドレスの後ろの赤い布は2枚でできていて、1枚の完全なものではありません。青色で表示されています)\n\nポーズ、背景、構図はおまかせします。\n\nありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/10DdcJ5", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@teniwohayukke/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4dcac79b/uploads/origins/784e65ba-a7dd-4a25-a467-31f70a5e0a2d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=79d7e790f5c1c60d08257fd94347d955", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4dcac79b/uploads/origins/784e65ba-a7dd-4a25-a467-31f70a5e0a2d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=79d7e790f5c1c60d08257fd94347d955, https://si.imgix.net/4dcac79b/uploads/origins/784e65ba-a7dd-4a25-a467-31f70a5e0a2d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ecfa71aebe799b48d9e9f42d8bc56bce 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4dcac79b/uploads/origins/784e65ba-a7dd-4a25-a467-31f70a5e0a2d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2f4f2a462568a3648bf44912c3f9a0b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello there! I really enjoy the composition of your artworks. \n\nI would like to request ディミトリ in his ファイアーエムブレム無双 風花雪月 design. The pose is up to you. ディミトリ is a king famed for his combat prowess, so I would like for the artwork to have an intimidating but regal aura. \n\nDrawing his weapon is not necessary, and you may simplify details of the armor. However, please do not change the hairstyle. \n\nOutfit reference: https://imgur.com/a/CTEtwJH\n\nIf possible, please include the Crest of Blaiddyd somewhere in the background.\n\nReference: https://imgur.com/4BO9p8g\n\nThank you for considering my request.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@teniwohayukke/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/32544a96/uploads/origins/eb3d4c54-a912-4c95-9e42-77c2bc4e92a4?bg=%23fff&auto=for